OL,3,GNEWSATwo in court over grandmother's
OL,4,Abike crash death
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have appeared in court accused
OL,7,Fof causing the death by dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving of a great-grandmother who was
OL,9,Fstruck by a motorcycle.
OL,11,FGillian Livingstone, 75, died and her
OL,12,Fgrandchild suffered a serious head
OL,13,Finjury when they were hit while
OL,14,Fcrossing Ennerdale Road in Cleator Moor
OL,15,Fon 26 May.
OL,17,FShaun Rafferty, 22, from Seaton, and
OL,18,FStefan Young, 24, of Moresby Parks,
OL,19,Fappeared at Carlisle Crown Court where
OL,20,Fthe judge heard allegations people were
OL,21,F"racing" when the crash happened.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
