OL,3,GNEWSATwo in court over grandmother's
OL,4,Abike crash death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair were bailed and are expected
OL,7,Fto stand trial on 19 July next year
OL,8,Falongside Kieran Yorke, 22, from
OL,9,FWorkington, who previous pleaded not
OL,10,Fguilty to causing the grandmother's
OL,11,Fdeath.
